---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="cta">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="cta__box">
			<svg class="cta__fil" viewBox="0 0 600 120" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
				<path
					d="M0 90c60 0 90-10 120-40 22-22 52-20 50 6-2 24-40 30-44 6-4-26 34-44 62-26 40 26 24 64 80 64h332"
					stroke="currentColor"
					stroke-width="2"
					stroke-linecap="round"></path>
			</svg>
			<h2>Et si vous retrouviez <span class="accent">le fil</span>&nbsp;?</h2>
			<p>
				Combien de livres pourriez-vous avoir lus dans six mois, si vous lisiez simplement autrement&nbsp;?
			</p>
			<div class="cta__actions">
				<a class="btn btn--primary" href="#formations">Choisir ma formation <Icon name="arrow" /></a>
				<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#test">Mesurer ma vitesse d'abord</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.cta {
		padding-block: var(--section-y);
	}

	.cta__box {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		padding: clamp(48px, 8vw, 96px) clamp(24px, 6vw, 80px);
		border-radius: var(--radius-l);
		background: var(--sand);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.cta__fil {
		position: absolute;
		left: -40px;
		bottom: 8px;
		width: min(70%, 600px);
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brown) 45%, transparent);
	}

	h2,
	p,
	.cta__actions {
		position: relative;
	}

	p {
		max-width: 34rem;
		margin: 20px auto 0;
		font-size: var(--step-1);
		color: var(--ink-soft);
	}

	.cta__actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 14px;
		margin-top: 36px;
	}
</style>
